    },
    {
      "end": 7653.6,
      "start": 7649.86,
      "text": "So what a great day it's been so far now this is exciting"
    },
    {
      "end": 7658.24,
      "start": 7653.6,
      "text": "Like I'm really really thrilled to be here with you today Kim"
    },
    {
      "end": 7662.32,
